          "Enhance"
        ],
        "description": "Zilong gets stronger the more he fights. As his Health declines, his potential is triggered: he enjoys greater damage reduction, and his basic skills are enhanced. Hidden Dragon: When his Health is more than 70% and less than or equal to 100%, he gains 5% damage reduction. Dragon Portent: When his Health is more than 40% and less than or equal to 70%, he gains 10% damage reduction. Dragon in Flight: When his Health is more than 0% and less than or equal to 40%, he gains 20% damage reduction. Any Health in excess of the current bracket will be converted into a permanent shield. When a shield Health bracket is full, excess shield value will be converted into Health instead."
      },
