        "description": "Lu Bu slashes in the target direction with his Crescent Halberd, dealing 600 (600 + 200% extra physical attack) physical damage to enemies within range. He loses his enhanced state if the slash does not hit an enemy hero. While enhanced, he recovers 130 (130 + 2.5% extra Health) Health whenever he hits an enemy with his Skill 1."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 2: Souleater",
        "cd": "8.5s",
        "mana_cost": "0",
        "tags": [
          "Shield",
          "Slow",
          "Recovery"
        ],
        "description": "Lu Bu captures the souls of enemies in the target area, dealing 100 (100 + 35% extra physical attack) physical damage and reducing their Movement Speed by 15% for 3s. Each captured soul grants him a shield, for up to 3 stacks. Each stack of shield negates 350 (350 + 7% extra Health) damage. He converts 25% of his remaining shield to Health every second, gaining 1 Health for every 2 points of shield."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 3: Tremble, Mortals",
        "cd": "50s",
        "mana_cost": "0",
        "tags": [
          "Crowd Control",
          "Movement",
          "Damage"
        ],
        "description": "Lu Bu leaps to the target location and creates a ring of slaughter, launching enemies within range for 1s. He gains crowd control immunity during the leap. Upon landing, he swings his Crescent Halberd, dealing 650 (650 + 240% extra physical attack) physical damage to enemies within range. While his Halberd is enchanted, he recovers 130 (130 + 2.5% extra Health) Health for every enemy hero hit. He gains 150 Physical Defense and Magical Defense within the ring. Enemies that touch the edge of the ring take 150 (150 + 75% extra physical attack) physical damage and are slowed by 30% for 2s. He restores Health for every enemy hero who takes damage this way."
      }
    ],
