          "Slow",
          "Mark"
        ],
        "description": "Zhou Yu's Basic Attacks and skills place fire marks on enemies (including structures) for 4s. At 4 stacks, the marks ignite, dealing 125 (125 + 17% ) magical damage per second for 4s and reducing the target's Movement Speed by 15% for 1s. Targets cannot gain more marks while burning."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 1: Wildfire",
        "cd": "5s",
        "mana_cost": "40",
        "tags": [
          "Crowd Control",
          "Speed Up",
          "Slow"
        ],
        "description": "Zhou Yu invokes a wind domain. Teammates within the domain gain 5% Movement Speed (up to 5 heroes; effect doubled for Zhou Yu), while enemy heroes' Movement Speed are reduced by 10% for 3s. When the wind is invoked, enemies within range are knocked back in the target direction and take 200 (200 + 30% ) magical damage. If the wind domain overlaps with a fire domain for 1s, a new fire domain spreads in the target direction, dealing 100 (100 + 25% ) magical damage every 0.5s. This damage stacks with any existing fire domains."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 2: Scorching Bolt",
        "cd": "0.6s",
        "mana_cost": "50",
        "tags": [
          "Damage",
          "Recovery"
        ],
        "description": "Zhou Yu calls down a volley of flaming arrows at the target location, dealing 250 (250 + 40% ) magical damage and leaving behind a fire domain that lasts for 6.5s. The fire domain deals 100 (100 + 30% ) magical damage to enemies within range every 0.5s. There can be up to 6 fire domains present at any time, after which creating a new fire domain will extinguish the first one. Zhou Yu stocks 1 volley every 9s (affected by Cooldown Reduction), and up to 3 can be stocked. Passive: While inside a fire domain, he recovers 35 (35 + 7% + 2% extra ) Health every 0.5s."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 3: Flames of War",
        "cd": "10s",
        "mana_cost": "60",
        "tags": [
          "Crowd Control",
          "Damage"
        ],
        "description": "Zhou Yu unleashes a burst of flames in the target area, dealing 200 (200 + 40% ) magical damage. If the flames travel through a fire domain, a firestorm is created, dealing an extra 200 (200 + 40% ) magical damage to enemies within range and stunning them for 1s."
