        ],
        "description": "Haya carries up to 3 moon crystals. Using Crescent Wave or Wayward Rays consumes 1 moon crystal. Once all are used, the skills enter full cooldown, and she gains an enhanced Basic Attack that fires 3 extra orbs, each dealing 50 (50 + 10% magical attack) magical damage. Targets hit by Crescent Wave or Wayward Rays will be marked, and hitting them again will trigger different effects."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 1: Crescent Wave",
        "cd": "7s",
        "mana_cost": "30",
