          "Shield",
          "Crowd Control",
          "Damage"
        ],
        "description": "Haya unleashes 3 glazed orbs, the first dealing 120 (120 + 22% magical attack) magical damage, and the next 2 dealing 60 (60 + 11% magical attack) magical damage. She also gains a shield that negates 250 (250 + 40% magical attack) damage for 3s and gradually gains Movement Speed over the next 2s, maxing out at a 30% increase. If she hits marked enemies, they will be stunned for 0.5s. Subsequent hits will only inflict 50% of the stun effect."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 3: Moonscape Mirage",
        "cd": "75s",
        "mana_cost": "70",
        "tags": [
          "Dreamscape",
          "Cooldown",
          "Shield"
        ],
        "description": "Haya links to a hero for 1.5s, gaining 50% damage reduction. The link breaks if they move too far apart, refunding 75% of Moonscape Mirage's cooldown. If the link remains unbroken after 1.5s, both enter the mirage, granting her a shield that negates 300 (300 + 70% magical attack) damage. While inside the mirage, her skill cooldowns are reduced by 50%. If she uses Moonscape Mirage again while inside the mirage, she moves 700 units away from the target."
