        "description": "Ziya places a divine seal on enemies in the target area, dealing 70 (70 + 14% Magical Attack) magical damage, followed by 60 (60 + 12% Magical Attack) magical damage every 0.4s for a total of 7 hits. Sealed enemies will gradually lose up to 30% of their Movement Speed and 10% of their Physical Defense and 10% of their Magical Defense. If the skill hits any enemy, he gains a 30% Movement Speed boost that diminishes over 1s."
