        "description": "Ziya unleashes divine retribution on wrongdoers, conjuring a magic circle that deals 3 strikes of damage to enemies in the target area. Each strike deals 60 (60 + 12% Magical Attack) magical damage. After a short delay, the magic circle explodes, dealing 300 (300 + 70% Magical Attack) magical damage to enemies and launching them for 0.75s."
