        "skill_name": "Ode",
        "cd": "12s",
        "mana_cost": "50",
        "tags": [
          "Damage",
          "Crowd Control"
        ],
        "description": "Dolia sings, unleashing 4 soundwaves that spread out around her. The first 3 deal 130 (130 + 20% magical damage) magical damage and inflict a 7.5% slow. The 4th soundwave deals 250 (250 + 40% magical damage) magical damage and inflicts a 30% slow for 1s. This soundwave triggers echoes when hitting enemies, dealing 150 (150 + 24% magical damage) magical damage. While in water, it stirs up a wave that knocks back nearby enemies and stuns enemies next to her. Echoes triggered by non-hero units have a shorter range and only deal 50% damage."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Wavemaker",
        "cd": "12.5s",
        "mana_cost": "60",
        "tags": [
          "Pool",
          "Dash",
          "Recovery"
        ],
        "description": "Dolia leaps forward and transforms into a mermaid. If she lands on solid ground, she creates a pool of water and restores 320 (320 + 40% Health) Health to her and her nearby teammates. While in the pool, teammates recover Health and Mana at the same rate as Dolia's. Cooldown is reduced by 25% if used while in water. The pool disappears if she leaves it for 4s."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Celestial Melody",
        "cd": "0s",
        "mana_cost": "100",
        "tags": [
          "CD Reset"
        ],
        "description": "Dolia channels for a short time, resetting the cooldown of a skill for a teammate within range. The skill that gets reset is the one with the longest remaining cooldown. In return, Dolia takes on a Cooldown of 10 (+120% of the current skill Cooldown) seconds herself. If the teammate does not use the reset skill, the cooldown of Celestial Melody is reduced by 20%. If the teammate uses the reset skill within 5s, it does not consume Energy, and any earnings from defeating enemies with that skill are shared evenly with Dolia. This skill prioritizes the teammate with whom she has formed a covenant. If no teammates are nearby, she resets one of her own skills. If the reset fails, the cooldown of Celestial Melody is significantly reduced."
      }
    ],
