        "description": "Fang marks a target, granting him 30% Attack Speed and 30 Movement Speed for 4s. The mark detonates after 4s, dealing 100 (100 + 65% AD) physical damage to enemies within range. Each Basic Attack landed on marked targets adds a stack to the mark, dealing 100 (100 + 65% AD) physical damage, up to 4 stacks. At 4 stacks, the mark will instantly detonate and the CD will be reset."
