        ],
        "description": "While in the brush, Chano gains 10-20% increased Movement Speed and accumulates Concealment, which reaches its maximum after 1s. When leaving the brush, he consumes Concealment to perform a leap, with the distance increasing based on the amount accumulated.\nEntering the brush also enhances his next Basic Attack into a double shot (counts as 1 Basic Attack), with each arrow dealing 175 (70 + 60%) physical damage. The double shot has a 4s cooldown.\nHe deals 25% more damage to monsters while in the brush."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 1: Soaring Signal",
        "cd": "7.5s",
        "mana_cost": "40",
        "tags": [
          "Damage",
          "Speed Up"
        ],
        "description": "Chano leaps into the air, gaining a Movement Speed boost and the ability to traverse terrain. While airborne, his Basic Attack becomes a powerful long-range arrow, dealing 475 (230 + 140%) physical damage and knocking back enemies (without applying crowd control), while also extending his air time.\nEach 1% Attack Speed increases the arrow's damage by 2.\nIf he doesn't use the enhanced Basic Attack while airborne, he stores one with normal Attack Range for 3s upon landing.\nIf he uses the enhanced Basic Attack while moving the movement wheel away from the target, he dashes for a short distance in that direction."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 2: Lupine Trap",
        "cd": "2s",
        "mana_cost": "50",
        "tags": [
          "Trap",
          "Summon",
          "Damage"
        ],
        "description": "Chano throws a wolf spirit trap at the target location, exposing the enemy that triggers it and dealing 380 (380 + 90% extra) physical damage. A wolf spirit is also summoned at the trap's location to attack the enemy that triggered it.\nTraps become invisible 2s after deploying. Up to 4 traps can be deployed simultaneously.\nThe wolf spirits inherit 25% of Chano's base stats and half of his Critical Damage, and each attack slows the target by 5-10% for 1s, for up to 5 stacks."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 3: Leader Stance",
        "cd": "50s",
        "mana_cost": "100",
        "tags": [
          "Mount",
          "Summon"
        ],
        "description": "Chano activates his Leader Stance, summoning (2 + Skill 2 charges) wolf spirits to charge in a designated direction, consuming stored charges of Skill 2 and activating all nearby traps. He gains the Mounted Archery ability, allowing him to move while attacking and increasing his Movement Speed by 10%, Physical Attack by 50, and Attack Speed by 20% for 8s.\nEach Basic Attack activates nearby targetless wolf spirits to join the attack."
      }
