        "description": "Releases a burst of power, dealing 300 (300 + 40% magical damage) magical damage to nearby enemies and creating a dark orb that orbits around him. Can have up to 3 dark orbs orbiting simultaneously. When this skill hits an enemy, its Cooldown and Mana cost are reduced by 50%. If there are already 3 dark orbs present, restores 150 (150 + 60% magical damage) Health instead. The number of dark orbs will influence the strength of Dark Impact."
      },
