        ],
        "description": "Donghuang consumes all of his dark orbs (there must be at least one) to barrage the target location, with each orb targeting a further area than the last. Orbs deal 500 (500 + 60% magical damage) magical damage to enemies within range. When he uses this skill, he gains 30% Movement Speed for 1s. He gains 10% Movement Speed for every extra dark orb consumed. The first orb slows enemies within range by 30% for 1s, the second slows enemies within range immensely for 1s, and the third will stun enemies within range for 1s."
      },
