        "description": "Donghuang suppresses an enemy hero for 2s. While the enemy is suppressed by him, both share all damage taken. He instantly gains 3 dark orbs when his Ultimate is used. During suppression, the orbs orbit 25% faster. Every 50 Magical Attack makes them orbit 5% faster, to a max of 100%."
