        "description": "Huang Zhong's Basic Attacks increase his physical attack by 6-12 and Critical Rate by 0.75%-1.5% (increases with hero level) for 1.5s, for up to 5 stacks. These buffs are doubled when he is in Turret Mode. When he enters or exits Turret Mode, the buffs' durations are refreshed, and the buff multiplier is replaced with the multiplier of the current mode."
