          "Damage"
        ],
        "description": "Huang Zhong places a landmine at the target location that grants him vision around it. The landmine deals 360 (360 + 80% extra physical attack) physical damage to enemies that come into contact with it, while also granting him vision of them for 3s. The landmine slows heroes by 25% and inflicts 10%-20% Sunder for 2s (value scales with skill level). At the same time, he gains a shield that negates 360 (360 + 5.5% extra max health) damage for 3s. While not in Turret Mode, he gains increased skill use speed if there are enemies within range. Up to 2 landmines can exist at the same time."
