        "description": "Huang Zhong dashes for a certain distance and deploys a turret. For the next 15s, he is immobile and gains 200 physical defense and 200 magical defense. Each of his Basic Attacks deals 350 physical damage to enemies at the center (40% less to enemies on the edge). He returns to his normal mode after 5-9 Basic Attacks (number scales with skill level). Damage to towers is reduced by 50%. Passive: When he enters Turret Mode, the cooldown of Unleash Your Potential will be refreshed. Using the skill again allows him to exit Turret Mode."
