        ],
        "description": "Shouyue gains 1 stack of Ambush for every 1.5s he is out of combat, for up to 5 stacks. When he has Ambush stacks, he gains 20% Physical Pierce and 70-140 (+ 15% extra physical attack) physical damage. Every Basic Attack hit on enemy heroes consumes 1 stack of Ambush, while every skill hit consumes 5 stacks.\nAccuracy: For every 1% Critical Rate, he deals 4 extra damage with Wild Wind and 2 extra damage with Getaway."
