          "Speed Up"
        ],
        "description": "Places a scouting device that provides vision within a range of 600-1,000 for 300s. He stocks 1 device every 35s, for up to 3 devices. Devices become ineffective when occupied by enemy heroes, and they become ineffective more quickly when occupied by multiple enemy heroes.\nPassive: When out of combat and near natural terrain or a scouting device, he disguises himself, gaining 15% Movement Speed and 15% Attack Speed. After losing his disguise, the Attack Speed boost will remain in effect for 3s."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Wild Wind",
        "cd": "1.5s",
        "mana_cost": "60",
        "tags": [
          "Damage",
          "Slow"
        ],
        "description": "Takes aim and snipes in the target direction, dealing 750 (750 + 250% extra physical attack) physical damage to targets hit, plus extra physical damage equal to 8% of the target's max health while slowing them immensely for 0.5s.\nAiming takes 2s, and bullets fired before the full duration have reduced accuracy. Up to 3 bullets can be stocked at a time. Landing a Basic Attack hit reduces the time taken to aim by 4%.\nWild Wind: When his Attack Speed is increased by 40%/80%/120%/160%, his aim time is reduced by 0.25/0.5/0.75/1s. The time taken for him to exit the aiming state is also reduced."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Getaway",
        "cd": "1.5s",
        "mana_cost": "90",
        "tags": [
          "Movement",
          "Damage",
          "Slow"
        ],
        "description": "Leaps backward and fires in the target direction, dealing 750 (750 + 180% extra physical attack) physical damage and slowing enemies in the path by 15% for 2s. Upon landing, gains 15% Movement Speed for 2s. Bullets stocked are shared with Wild Wind, and 1 bullet is used with each skill use.\nUsing Basic Attacks or skills removes the Movement Speed boost instantly.\nPassive: Increases Basic Attack range by 15 with every skill level upgrade."
