  "197": {
    "hero_name": "Yixing",
    "skills": [
      {
        "skill_name": "Passive Skill: Maintaining Initiative",
        "cd": null,
        "mana_cost": null,
        "tags": [
          "Immunity",
          "Mark",
          "Damage"
        ],
        "description": "Yixing's Basic Attacks deal magical damage, and skill hits apply 1 stack of Anti-Qi. At 4 stacks, a Weiqi stone is summoned below the enemy, dealing 100 (100 + 10% AP) magical damage. This Weiqi stone is then pulled to the center of Skill 2's Weiqi formation, dealing 170 (170 + 11% AP) magical damage to enemies in its path. He gains 1 permanent Weiqi stone every time Anti-Qi marks are triggered, as well as 5 Weiqi stones every 60s and whenever he scores a kill or assist. Each permanent Weiqi stone grants 1 AP.\nWhen taking fatal damage, he enters the void, summoning a Weiqi stone below his feet while gaining immunity to all damage and 30% Movement Speed for 1s. This effect has a cooldown of 150s.\nWhen Weiqi stones summoned by Anti-Qi marks hit an enemy multiple times within a short duration, subsequent hits deal only 50% damage."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 1: Sliding Stones",
        "cd": "1.5s",
        "mana_cost": "30",
        "tags": [
          "Damage",
          "Vision",
          "Slow"
        ],
        "description": "Places a Weiqi stone at the target location, gaining vision around it for 3s, dealing 100 (100 + 18% AP) magical damage, and reducing Taking Liberties' cooldown by 0.5s. The Weiqi stone lasts for 12s, and if a Weiqi formation is created, it will be pulled toward its center, dealing 180 (180 + 36% AP) magical damage to enemies in its path while slowing them by 25% for 1s. Hitting an enemy in this way will enhance his Basic Attack to deal 223 (120 + 60% AD + 18% AP) magical damage.\nAt 50/110/181 permanent Weiqi Stones, he gains an extra one-off skill that further improves his enhanced Basic Attack and grants a burst of Movement Speed for 5s. The enhanced Basic Attack improvements are a scattershot effect/17% damage boost/34% damage boost.\nHe stocks 1 Weiqi stone every 6s, for up to 2 stones. If an enemy is hit by multiple Weiqi stones being pulled to the Weiqi formation within 0.5s, subsequent hits only deal 50% of the initial damage. On-hit effects of enhanced Basic Attacks are reduced to 30%."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 2: Taking Liberties",
        "cd": "10s",
        "mana_cost": "55",
        "tags": [
          "Crowd Control",
          "Damage",
          "Mark"
        ],
        "description": "Yixing deals 160 (160 + 25% AP) magical damage in the target area, which expands into a Weiqi formation. Enemies within the central area take 160 (160 + 25% AP) extra magical damage and are pulled toward the center of the formation.\nThe Weiqi formation lasts 10s. If Yixing passes through the formation's edge, he gains a 50% Movement Speed increase that diminishes over 1s, while enemy heroes that do so gain a stack of Anti-Qi. Each effect can only be triggered once. If Yixing moves too far away from the formation, it disappears.\nThis skill deals 180% more damage to non-hero units."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 3: The World is My Board",
        "cd": "60s",
        "mana_cost": "90",
        "tags": [
          "Confine",
          "Crowd Control",
          "Mark"
        ],
        "description": "Yixing's position becomes the corner of a void Weiqi board. After 1.5s, the board takes shape and launches enemies within it for 0.5s. The Weiqi board lasts for 4s, during which enemy heroes cannot leave it. The board adds 3 Anti-Qi marks to enemy heroes over time and exposes their location. If he successfully traps an enemy hero, he gains 1 charge of Sliding Stones.\nThe smaller the Weiqi board, the shorter the cooldown, for a maximum reduction of 25%.\nWhen the Weiqi board is fully formed, Yixing gains 30-70% Movement Speed that diminishes over time."
      }
    ],
    "meta": {
