        "skill_name": "Skill 1: Enchanted Arrows",
        "cd": "1s",
        "mana_cost": "None",
        "tags": [
          "Enhance",
          "Damage"
        ],
        "description": "Garo enchants her longbow, extending her attack interval by 25% but also increasing her attack range by 125. Every Basic Attack costs 50 Mana and deals an extra 32 (32 + 7% extra magical damage) magical damage every 0.5s for 2s. This skill can be used again to cancel the enchantment, increasing her Movement Speed by 20 and restoring her attack interval and range. Every Basic Attack restores 6 (5 + 1% physical damage) Mana on hit and an extra 200% Mana when the target is an enemy hero."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 2: Silent Arrow",
        "cd": "12s",
        "mana_cost": "50",
        "tags": [
          "Damage",
          "Crowd Control"
        ],
        "description": "Garo shoots a piercing arrow in the target direction, dealing 300 (300 + 60% extra physical damage) magical damage to enemies in its path while silencing them for 0.5s and reducing their Movement Speed by 25% for 1s. After a delay of 1s, the area the arrow passed through explodes, dealing 600 (600 + 120% extra physical damage) magical damage to enemies within range. She casts the skill faster as she gains Attack Speed. Casting speed increases by 1% for every 1.5% Attack Speed, for a maximum increase of 100%."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 3: Sphere of Purity",
        "cd": "45s",
        "mana_cost": "80",
        "tags": [
          "Enhance",
          "Speed Up",
          "Damage"
        ],
        "description": "Garo creates a magic circle in her current location for 8s. Using this skill again will destroy the magic circle. When she is in the circle, she gains 20% Movement Speed and 20% Critical Rate. Upon destroying the magic circle, she gains 20% Movement Speed and 20% Critical Rate if she is inside it, or half of these bonuses if she is outside it. Creating or destroying the magic circle will deal 380 (380 + 85% extra physical damage) magical damage to enemies within range. Passive: Critical hits from her Basic Attacks reduce the target's Movement Speed by 30% for 0.5s. If her Basic Attack lands a critical hit on the same target again within 1s, the Movement Speed reduction is increased to 50%."
      }
    ],
