        "description": "Sun Ce dashes in the target direction, dealing 199 (125 + 45% physical attack) physical damage to enemies in his path. At the end of the dash, he deals 399 (250 + 90% physical attack) physical damage to enemies within range.\nAfter a short delay, he deals another strike of equal physical damage to enemies within range and launches them for 1s."
