        "description": "Sun Ce strides forward and hacks at enemies within the target area, dealing 296 (180 + 70% physical attack) physical damage and placing 1 stack of slow on them. Each stack reduces the target's Movement Speed by 15% for 2s, for up to 3 stacks. He can use this skill 3 times before it enters cooldown, with each hack dealing 25% more physical damage than the previous one.\nThe cooldown of the Basic Attack is refreshed every time he uses this skill."
