          "Crowd Control",
          "Damage",
          "Board"
        ],
        "description": "Sun Ce gains crowd control immunity and pilots his ship forward for 12s. While moving, the ship accelerates continuously and knocks back enemy minions and non-ancient monsters in its path, dealing 549 (350 + 120% physical attack) physical damage to them.\nHe can disembark while moving by using the skill again. When the ship collides with a wall, structure, ancient monster, or enemy hero, or when the time is up, it will explode. The explosion deals 549 (350 + 120% physical attack) physical damage to enemies within range and launches them for 1-1.5s (duration increases with time traveled).\nHe gains 5 stacks of Undaunted if the ship's explosion hits an enemy.\nWhile he is piloting the ship, a nearby teammate can tap a button to embark. The teammate will disembark when they are hit by hard crowd control, when they use a movement skill, or when Sun Ce disembarks."
      }
