        "description": "Augran's Basic Attacks vibrate his dagger-axe to resonate with an enemy's soul for 3s. The soul resonance deals 88 (50% physical attack) physical damage upon connection and will continue to deal damage with increasing frequency unless it is broken. When it ends, it deals a further 211 (70 + 80% physical attack) magical damage.\nThe soul resonance's initial and final damage carry 100% of the on-hit effect, while the rest carries 50%."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 1: Path of Passing",
        "cd": "12.5s",
        "mana_cost": "60",
        "tags": [
          "Speed Up",
          "Damage",
          "Slow"
        ],
        "description": "Augran carves a path to the afterlife, dealing 280 (280 + 95% extra physical attack) magical damage to targets it hits.\nThe path accelerates after hitting walls or the Life-Death Border, then deals an additional 150 (150 + 60% extra physical attack) magical damage to enemies hit. While on the path, Augran ignores terrain and gains 50% Movement Speed. The first time the path hits a wall, it creates an afterlife bridge. When Augran traverses the bridge, he gains a burst of Movement Speed, while nearby enemies are slowed by 15%.\nAugran can use this skill again to recall his dagger-axe, entering the Seer State for 4s. If his Basic Attacks target an enemy with less than 10% Health (750-1,500 for monsters depending on hero level), Augran will instantly execute them.\nThis skill deals full contact damage to non-hero units. The dagger-axe will automatically be summoned back when the skill's cooldown ends."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 2: Death's Precipice",
        "cd": "10s",
        "mana_cost": "50",
