        "description": "Shoots a heavy round in the target direction, dealing 200 (200 + 50% extra physical attack) physical damage to all enemies hit and slowing them by 25% for 2s. When the round hits an enemy or wall, or reaches its maximum range, it explodes and splits into 5 splinters that can ricochet off walls and deal 410 (410 + 100% extra physical attack) physical damage to the first enemy they hit.\nExcited: The number of splinters increases from 5 to 9.\nGains 5 Anger every time rounds or splinters hit an enemy. If multiple splinters hit the same target within 1s, subsequent hits only deal 25% damage."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Missile Mayhem",
        "cd": "60s",
        "mana_cost": "0",
        "tags": "Damage",
        "description": "Meng Ya scans the vicinity and marks the locations of enemies within range when they take damage from his teammates (up to 5 locations can be marked). When the scan is complete, he fires missiles that deal 450 (450 + 120% extra physical attack) physical damage. Subsequent hits on the same target deal 75% less damage and grant 10 Anger. He continues to fire up to 1 missile every second for 8s after the scan. 50% of the skill's cooldown is refunded if the skill is canceled or interrupted.\nExcited: The minimum interval between subsequent missiles is reduced from 1s to 0.5s.\nThe skill button can be held down for up to 3s to expand the scan range. He gains 50% Movement Speed while scanning."
      }
    ],
