          "Damage"
        ],
        "description": "Agudo has an affinity with the monsters of the Gorge. When she's near a monster, Recovery will be replaced with Release (grants buffs).\nUpon hitting enemies, Agudo's Basic Attacks will drop Seed Mines and absorb nearby mines: She can pick up mines to gain 3% Attack Speed and Movement Speed for 2.5s, for up to 6 stacks.\nEnemies that come into contact with a mine will take 30 (30 + 10% extra physical damage)."
