        "skill_name": "Skill 1: Wild Growth",
        "cd": "15s",
        "mana_cost": "50",
        "tags": [
          "Summon",
          "Speed Up"
        ],
        "description": "Agudo sows a field in the target area, creating an animal wonderland that provides Agudo and her animal companions with 15% Attack Speed and Movement Speed, while granting 40 (40 + 0.6% extra Health). Her animal companions will come to the field and fight alongside Agudo. Animal companions' stats scale with Agudo's hero level, while the chance of summoning more companions scales with skill level.\nAnimal companions gain additional Attack, Attack Speed, and Critical Rate based on 50% of Agudo's stats."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 2: Tumble, Furball!",
        "cd": "12.5s",
        "mana_cost": "45",
        "tags": [
          "Speed Up",
          "Immunity",
          "Damage"
        ],
        "description": "Tumble, Furball!: Agudo rolls forward with Furball, gaining 40 Block and immunity to 1 hard crowd control while rolling. Also deals 240 (240 + 80% extra physical damage) to any enemies she hits and stuns them for 1/2s. If they hit a wall before the end of the roll, they'll ricochet up to 3 times, resetting the rolling distance while increasing the skill's effect by 25%. Agudo also enhances her next Basic Attack to shoot 3 Seed Mines and deal 60 (60 + 20% extra physical damage).\nTumble, Agudo!: Agudo rolls forward and enhances her next Basic Attack to shoot 3 Seed Mines and deal 60 (60 + 20% extra physical damage)."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 3: Gorge Mobilization",
        "cd": "40s",
        "mana_cost": "80",
        "tags": [
          "Summon",
          "Crowd Control",
          "Damage"
        ],
        "description": "While riding Furball: Agudo commands Furball to leap to the target location, dealing 460 (460 + 150% extra physical damage) to enemies and stunning them for 2/3s. After that, Furball will battle independently while inheriting 50% of Agudo's stats and 100% of her on-hit effects.\nWhile not riding Furball: When Furball is defeated, it will enter recovery mode. It can rejoin the battle after its Health is fully restored.\nShe can call Furball back before the skill duration ends."
      }
    ],
