          "Recovery",
          "Damage"
        ],
        "description": "Ying strikes 3 times, dealing 129 (60 + 40% physical damage) with each of the first two strikes and restoring 90 (90 + 1.3% extra max HP) Health. The final strike deals 258 (120 + 80% physical damage) and restores 180 (180 + 2.5% extra max HP) Health.\nThis skill is cast by using an enhanced Basic Attack at 2 stacks of Spear Will. The lower her Health, the greater the recovery effect (up to 2x)."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Spear Will (3 stacks): Zenith - Wildfire",
        "cd": "1s",
        "mana_cost": null,
        "tags": [
          "Damage",
          "Enhance"
        ],
        "description": "Ying leaps into the air and charges up before unleashing a sweeping strike, dealing 333 (160 + 100% physical damage) to enemies in its path. The lower the target's Health, the greater the damage, up to a maximum of 666 (320 + 200% physical damage) when the target's Health is below 50%.\nThis skill is cast by using an enhanced Basic Attack at 3 stacks of Spear Will. While airborne, Ying ignores terrain, gains 200% movement speed, and gains 10% damage reduction."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 1: Moonslash",
        "cd": "10s",
        "mana_cost": "40",
        "tags": [
          "Crowd Control",
          "Damage"
        ],
        "description": "Ying swings her spear upward, then slashes downward, executing 2 strikes that each deal 180 (180 + 60% extra physical damage). The upward strike launches enemies for 0.5s."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 2: Cloudchaser",
        "cd": "10s",
        "mana_cost": "40",
        "tags": [
          "Movement",
          "Speed Up",
          "Damage"
        ],
        "description": "Ying raises her spear and charges up, gaining up to 25% movement speed. After charging, she dashes forward and executes a horizontal sweep, dealing 180 (180 + 60% extra physical damage) - 360 (360 + 120% extra physical damage) to enemies and slowing them by 15% for 1s."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Skill 3: Starburn",
        "cd": "40s",
        "mana_cost": "80",
        "tags": [
          "Dash",
          "Crowd Control",
          "Immunity"
        ],
        "description": "Ying ignites Sweeping Fire's tip and dashes back and forth through the area before her. Each dash deals 180 (180 + 60% extra physical damage) and launches enemies. Upon dashing to maximum range, she launches a flurry of stabs. Each stab deals 90 (90 + 30% extra physical damage), for a total of 4 stabs.\nWhile using this skill, Ying gains crowd control immunity and 30% damage reduction.\nUpon activating the second phase of the skill, Roaring Sun, she sweeps forward with Sweeping Fire, leaving a trail of fire behind. The sweep deals 180 (180 + 60% extra physical damage), and the trail of fire deals 50 (50 + 16% extra magical damage) every 0.2s over 3s, for a total of 1 time.\nWhile Starburn is active, the second phase of the skill can be used to sweep the area around her, interrupting subsequent dashes, dealing 120 (120 + 40% extra physical damage), and leaving a circular trail of fire behind for 3s."
      }
    ],
