        ],
        "description": "Heino engages in combat in either melee or ranged mode as fate dictates. His skills and melee Basic Attacks mark enemies for 7s on hit.\nRanged: He channels the Power of Fate to attack distant enemies, dealing 165 (100% physical damage) physical damage and (15% magical damage) magical damage.\nMelee: He brandishes his scepter to attack all nearby enemies, dealing 165 (100% physical damage) physical damage and (45% magical damage) magical damage.",
