        ],
        "description": "Heino reduces his cooldown by 0.2s for each marked enemy hit, up to 1s.\nRanged: He turns his scepter into energy and throws it, dealing 410 (410 + 75% magical damage) magical damage upon hit. He also throws 1 extra scepter at every marked enemy in front of him, dealing 75% damage.\nMelee: He throws his scepter spinning, dealing 260 (260 + 45% magical damage) magical damage to enemies in its path and slowing them by 15% for 2s. He recovers 150 (150 + 5% extra Health) Health for each target hit.\nRanged: When extra scepters hit the same target multiple times, subsequent hits only deal 50% of the initial damage. Melee: Recovers Health up to 3 times.",
