  "564": {
    "hero_name": "Mayene",
    "skills": [
      {
        "skill_name": "Slack Off a Lil Bit",
        "cd": "0",
        "mana_cost": "0",
        "tags": "Recover",
        "description": "Mayene's skills consume Punch Strength or Kick Strength. When idle and not taking damage, she sits down to slack off, accelerating Strength recovery by 25%. While slacking, she snacks on treats, randomly recovering 110 (110 + 2% extra Health) x 1/1.5/2 Health.\nAttacking, taking damage, or moving interrupts this effect. She won't slack off in Serious State.\nUsing a different skill combo within 3s of another boosts its effect by 25%."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Whatever (I)",
        "cd": "0s",
        "mana_cost": "0",
        "tags": "Damage, Crowd Control, Movement",
        "description": "Mayene runs forward and pulls in enemies in front of her, dealing 300 (300 + 100% extra physical attack) physical damage to enemies in a cone-shaped area and slowing them by 30% for 1s.\nExploit Weakness: When using Whatever (I) again quickly after, she will leap into the air and deliver a powerful strike, dealing 400 (400 + 125% extra physical attack) physical damage to enemies within range and extra physical damage equal to 10% of the target's Health, as well as launching them for 1s.\nDeals 50% extra damage to enemies in the center of the skill.\nMayene takes 25% less damage while using the skill.\nFeint to Retreat: Mayene delivers a smooth combo of strikes, starting with 3 punches that deal 200 (200 + 70% extra physical attack) physical damage each, followed by a knee strike that deals 200 (200 + 70% extra physical attack) physical damage while pushing the target backward slightly (not a crowd control effect). She also recovers 200 (200 + 5% extra Health) Health.\nThis skill costs 1 Punch Strength. She recovers 1 Punch Strength every 8.5s (affected by Cooldown Reduction), and can stock up to 2 bars at a time."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Whatever (II)",
        "cd": "0s",
        "mana_cost": "0",
        "tags": "Immunity, Damage Reduction, Movement",
        "description": "Mayene flips forward, during which she has crowd control immunity, gains 30% damage reduction and recovers 200 (200 + 5% extra Health) Health.\nFlee Danger: When using Whatever (II) again quickly after, she delivers a flying kick to the enemy, dealing 500 (500 + 150% extra physical attack) physical damage and recovering 200 (200 + 5% extra Health) Health. She then somersaults into the air, during which she has crowd control immunity and 25% damage reduction, and recovers 300 (300 + 5% extra Health) Health.\nDefend by Attacking: When using Whatever (I) quickly after, she blinks behind the enemy and delivers a spinning kick, knocking back the target and dealing 350 (350 + 110% extra physical attack) (+ 15% of the target's lost Health) physical damage.\nIf the target is defeated, she recovers 300 (300 + 5% extra Health) Health, as well as 50% Punch and Kick Strength. These effects are doubled if she defeats an enemy hero.\nThis skill costs 1 Kick Strength. She recovers 1 Kick Strength every 8.5s (affected by Cooldown Reduction), and can stock up to 2 bars at a time."
      },
      {
        "skill_name": "Get Serious",
        "cd": "60s",
        "mana_cost": "0",
        "tags": "Enhance, Haste, Damage",
        "description": "Mayene gets serious, dealing 360 (360 + 100% extra physical damage) physical damage to nearby enemies.\nUpon entering the Serious State, she recovers 1 Punch Strength and Kick Strength, and max Strength is increased to 3 bars each. The Serious State lasts for 10s, during which she gains 15% Movement Speed, and any slowing effect inflicted on her is reduced by 50%."
      }
    ],
